ve attitude. Makes","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"decisions independently and knows when to ask for assistance. Exercises good","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"judgment and arrives at sound decisions.","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"5. Basic Patient Care:","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"a. Performs basic nursing tasks providing for patient’s physical hygiene,","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"including bathing, hair care, bowel care, oral care, and measures vital","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"signs, including pain level.","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"b. Reacts appropriately in an emergency.","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"c. Takes precautions against infections following Standard Precautions and","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"appropriate isolation techniques.","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"d. Utilizes proper positioning techniques to maintain patient’s body","source_heading":"Qualifications","source_subheading":null},{"item_type":"technical_skill","requirement_level":null,"item_text":"alignment and pr